{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you run a bee motel and solve the clues to find your guests among dozens of other bees? Enjoy some cozy, relaxing moments with the sweetest little bees you\u2019ve ever met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imka, Hop and you are the team of the Bee Welcome Hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help them find your special guests among dozens of similar bees!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837750/extras/bee.gif?t=1739290190\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a Surfer Bee, a Honey Dabber Bee or a Unicorn Bee, Imka's bee hotel is open to everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want to be the best bee hotelier? Come and find them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of different bees!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beach bees!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dancing bees!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Glowing alien bees!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">... and many more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Beardshakers wish you a lot of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anke, Bene and Michael</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2837750?t=1739290190","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837750/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739290190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837750/11475d74d5376119abe7a84348a6ccd527bbc811/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739290190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837750/11475d74d5376119abe7a84348a6ccd527bbc811/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739290190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family S